spaces-alpha.json is vlpds's testdata/spaces-alpha/vectors.json, copied
unmodified from https://github.com/jazware/vlpds (mirrored at
mexico-parasocial/vlpds) at release v1.1.0.

vlpds generated it by running the reference implementation (this package's
src, bluesky-social/atproto PR #5187 at
5b95b2f2723a2882824fbb0b819fd6aad884ef20) with fixed keys, and its Rust
implementation asserts the same vectors. These fixtures remain historical:
the current reference pin uses STAR, tagged credential signatures and KEM MACs.
vectors.test.ts still verifies unchanged LtHash/set-hash/token vectors and
asserts rejection of legacy HTTP signatures and the #atproto_space token key.
The historical commit signatures no longer match the current commit schema.
Passing this suite does not establish current vlpds interoperability.

License: MIT (bluesky-social/atproto). To update: when packages/space moves to
a newer reference commit, add vectors.json from the vlpds commit whose
testdata/spaces-alpha/SOURCE names that same commit.
